---
/**
 * Homepage rhythm-break: a dark technical section.
 * Reuses only homepage-supported concepts: energy storage, DC charging,
 * and selected AC / PV-storage capabilities.
 *
 * TODO(engineering): verify whether PV and grid should be drawn as
 * interchangeable inputs, and whether AC output is always a parallel
 * path to DC charging. Until confirmed, this diagram stays abstract:
 * ENERGY INPUT → STORAGE → OUTPUT / LOAD.
 */
---

<section class="energy-flow" aria-labelledby="energy-flow-heading">
  <div class="energy-flow-inner">
    <p class="label-tech">Energy flow</p>
    <h2 id="energy-flow-heading" class="energy-flow-title">One platform. Multiple deployment paths.</h2>
    <p class="energy-flow-body">The TKMC range combines energy storage, DC charging, and selected AC or PV-storage capabilities across mobile and stationary deployment formats.</p>

    <div class="energy-diagram" aria-hidden="true">
      <div class="energy-node">
        <span class="energy-node-id">01</span>
        <span class="energy-node-label">Energy input</span>
        <span class="energy-node-meta">PV · Grid</span>
      </div>
      <div class="energy-line energy-line-pulse"></div>
      <div class="energy-core">
        <span class="energy-node-id">02</span>
        <span class="energy-node-label">TKMC storage</span>
        <span class="energy-node-meta">Energy core</span>
      </div>
      <div class="energy-line"></div>
      <div class="energy-node">
        <span class="energy-node-id">03</span>
        <span class="energy-node-label">Output / load</span>
        <span class="energy-node-meta">EV · AC load</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="energy-flow-note">Conceptual path from catalog-supported capabilities. Final configuration is project-specific.</p>

    <ul class="energy-caps">
      <li><span>Storage</span></li>
      <li><span>DC charging</span></li>
      <li><span>AC output</span></li>
      <li><span>PV input</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
